    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Dick Pogue shaped Cleveland's legal, business, civic, and educational institutions through decades of leadership at Jones Day and regional boards. His career included military legal service, antitrust and corporate practice, managing-partner leadership during Jones Day's national and international growth, and sustained support for universities, arts organizations, and global business connections."
    ]
